      "briefing": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Moraine Data Retrieval\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nThis is a little outside our usual purview, but with the Moraine attacking more often, we’re hoping to find out where they’re operating and steer crews clear of those areas.\n\nWe need someone to infiltrate a suspected Moraine facility and make a copy of their server data. We’ve been told that the station is rarely occupied but it’s possible that you will encounter Moraine there, so be careful.\n\nWhile we don’t advocate violence, the potential benefits of this intel will be able to save many lives on both sides.\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon delivery\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
